    "title": "Tiger Woods packs on PDA with Vanessa Trump, bonds with her daughters during golf match",
    "text": "Tiger Woods and Vanessa Trump had a rare PDA moment at a golf match in Florida on Tuesday. The athlete, 50, was photographed embracing his girlfriend, 48, and planting a kiss on her cheek. The couple were also caught on camera smiling at each other as Woods played. Tiger Woods and Vanessa Trump smooched at a golf match Tuesday. GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images The athlete planted a kiss on his girlfriend’s cheek at the TGL finals. / SplashNews.com Trump attended the TGL Finals at Palm Beach Garden’s SoFi Center with two of her daughters — Kai, 18, and Chloe, 11 — whom Woods chatted with. He and Trump went public with their romance last year. “Love is in the air and life is better with you by my side!” Woods captioned their March 2025 Instagram debut. “We look forward to our journey through life together.” The duo smiled at each other as the pro golfer played. GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images Woods also bonded with Trump’s daughters, Kai (middle) and Chloe (left). GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images Want more celebrity and pop culture news? Start your day with Page Six Daily. Thanks for signing up! Woods was previously married to Elin Nordegren, welcoming daughter Sam, 18, and son Charlie, 17, before his serial affairs ended their five-year marriage. Trump, for her part, co-parents five children with ex-husband Donald Trump Jr. The former couple were married from 2005 to 2018. The event took place at the SoFi Center in Palm Beach Gardens, Fla. TGL Golf via Getty Images Trump and Woods went public with their romance in March 2025. Twitter/tigerwoods She and Woods are now “wedding bells serious,” a source close to Vanessa told Page Six in July 2025. The insider gushed, “She’s so happy! She’s finally found happiness. She’s found happiness for the first time in her life.” While Vanessa and Woods keep their relationship primarily under wraps, they’ve made headlines for multiple joint outings. We hear the pair (pictured above in March 2025) are “wedding bells serious.” Twitter/tigerwoods Vanessa was previously married to Donald Trump Jr. (pictured above in August 2024), while Woods divorced Elin Nordegren after a slew of affairs. Kai Trump/Instagram Most recently, Vanessa and Kai attended Woods’ lavish 50th birthday bash in January. Kai, two months prior, revealed advice she’d been given by her mom’s boyfriend while preparing for her pro golf debut. “He told me to go out there and have fun and just go with the flow. Whatever happens, happens,” the teen said in November 2025, labeling Woods the “best golfer in the entire world” and an “even better person.”",
